{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>These are the sons of Seir the Horite.</b> He mentions by name the mighty men who were then men of renown, to make known that even so the children of Esau destroyed them by the will of the blessed El, as it says: כַּאֲשֶׁר עָשָׂה לִבְנֵי עֵשָׂו הַיּוֹשְׁבִים בְּשֵׂעִיר וְכוּ׳ (Deuteronomy 2:22)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:27.709785122Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}